    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One must imagine Sisyphus <i>wealthy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the famous Greek myth, now YOU can also roll a boulder indefinitely! Earn money, unlock upgrades and collect decorations for your customizable boulder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/extras/71dba0c17fc26ce2c96c408585bc1bfb.poster.avif?t=1755559125\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/extras/71dba0c17fc26ce2c96c408585bc1bfb.webm?t=1755559125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/extras/71dba0c17fc26ce2c96c408585bc1bfb.mp4?t=1755559125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply click and hold to roll</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique art style inspired by ancient Greek pottery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach speeds of up to hundreds of kilometers per hour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9+ different unlockable Boulders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ humorous unlockable Stickers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ unlockable Backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sounds and ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-developed</strong> with <strong>NO generative tools!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One must imagine Sisyphus <i>wealthy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the famous Greek myth, now YOU can also roll a boulder indefinitely! Earn money, unlock upgrades and collect decorations for your customizable boulder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/extras/71dba0c17fc26ce2c96c408585bc1bfb.poster.avif?t=1755559125\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/extras/71dba0c17fc26ce2c96c408585bc1bfb.webm?t=1755559125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/extras/71dba0c17fc26ce2c96c408585bc1bfb.mp4?t=1755559125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply click and hold to roll</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique art style inspired by ancient Greek pottery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach speeds of up to hundreds of kilometers per hour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9+ different unlockable Boulders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ humorous unlockable Stickers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ unlockable Backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sounds and ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-developed</strong> with <strong>NO generative tools!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
